UID:PuRoqDl6LqunlzlWeXG9R
SUMMARY:Magical Morning Paddle on the Bay 🚣‍♀️
DTSTAMP:20260810T042043Z
DTSTART:20260815T134500Z
DESCRIPTION:Start your day gliding across the calm waters of Galveston Bay—
	it’s peaceful\, scenic\, and unforgettable! Registration required!🌊\n\nFro
